<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμάζω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw the spear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμὰς αἰχμάσσουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.324
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδον αἰχμάζειν</span>
			<i>play the warrior</i> at home, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				756
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰχμάσαι τάδε</span>
			<i>to perform</i> these <i>feats of arms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				355
			</span></i>; <i>'trail a pike'</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				284
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>arm with the spear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς Ἀτρείδαισιν ᾔχμασας χέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					97
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of general's speech, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν διάνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					1.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>wound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				35.178
			</span></i> s.v.l.</div>
